inistrative features",[239,323,324,325,328],{},"You can enable or disable superuser mode from the ",[261,326,327],{},"user menu"," in the left sidebar.",[253,330,333],{"icon":331,"color":332},"i-mdi-lightbulb-on-outline","info",[239,334,335],{},"If you want to explore as much of FiveNet as possible, start with the police character and enable superuser mode.",[266,337,339],{"id":338},"feedback","Feedback",[239,341,342],{},"If you run into problems or have suggestions, reach out to the FiveNet team on Discord.",{"title":280,"searchDepth":344,"depth":344,"links":345},2,[346,347,348],{"id":268,"depth":344,"text":269},{"id":292,"depth":344,"text":293},{"id":338,"depth":344,"text":339},"Try FiveNet using the public demo instance.","md",null,{},true,{"title":16,"description":349},"zmgFGSF0IMz-keHr9k8AtB3j52j6y5BtxHX8AKsWRoc",[357,359],{"title":12,"path":13,"stem":14,"description":358,"children":-1},"Overview of the features provided by FiveNet, including details about the frontend, backend, and gameserver plugins.",{"title":20,"path":21,"stem":22,"description":360,"children":-1},"Infrastructure and software requirements for running FiveNet.",1789156020186]